name: build
description: dotnet build Berreman.slnx Release (F# numerical optics solver)
kind: command
phase: build
command: "dotnet build Berreman.slnx -c Release -nologo -v:m"
cwd: Berreman
pass_when:
  exit_code: 0
  stdout_match: (?s)^(?!.*error).*$
runtime_estimate_seconds: 600
runtime_actual_seconds: 65
tags: [build]
applies_to:
  - paths: ["Berreman/**/*.fs", "Berreman/**/*.fsproj", "Berreman/**/*.slnx", "Directory.Build.props", "Directory.Build.targets", "Berreman/Berreman/BuildInfo.ps1", "Berreman/PreBuild/**"]
qualifier: build
builds: [Berreman/Berreman.slnx]
---
name: elevation
description: "Elevation analyzers (ELEV004 excluded) over the Berreman projects a step ACTUALLY touches. Elevation/Run-ElevationGate.ps1 runs STL's Softellect.Analyzers package, at the version the root Directory.Build.targets pins, through fsharp-analyzers over each F# product project of Berreman.slnx that compiles a changed .fs, plus the projects that reference it, because the duplicate-name rules (ELEV014/015/016/019) see a collision only from downstream; a change to .elevation-analyzers.json, a solution or the root Directory.Build.props / .targets widens the run to all 13. A finding recorded in Elevation/elevation-known-findings.json (the 3,757 the tree had when the gates were set up, which the ledger specs/0048/.manual/002-elevation-ledger.jsonl closes row by row) does not fail; a new one does, and so does a recorded one that is no longer found, so a fix deletes its entry in the same step. ELEV004 is excluded HERE, in the command and not in the rules, as in STL's gates, so a full analyzer run still measures it (spec 0048 .manual/002 R7). Requires build: the analyzers read each project's references as built. Measured 240 s for all 13 projects at throttle 4 (specs/0048/.manual/001)."
kind: command
phase: verify
command: powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File Elevation/Run-ElevationGate.ps1 -ExcludeRules ELEV004
pass_when:
  exit_code: 0
  stdout_match: "(?m)^ELEV-GATE: OK\\b"
  failure_capture: "(?m)^FAILED:\\s+(.+?)\\r?$"
runtime_estimate_seconds: 600
priority: 10
silent_for_seconds: 600
tags: [lint, elevation]
applies_to:
  - paths: ["Berreman/**/*.fs", "Berreman/**/*.fsproj", "Berreman/Berreman.slnx", ".elevation-analyzers.json", "Elevation/elevation-known-findings.json", "Directory.Build.props", "Directory.Build.targets"]
qualifier: source
requires_path: [Elevation/Run-ElevationGate.ps1]
requires_gates: [build]
scope: working_tree
---
name: constructor-unit-tests
description: dotnet test over the OpticalConstructor UI-less projects (Domain beam-tree orchestration, Storage JSON round-trip + schema validation, Optimization interface, units spine) — spec 0022 §A.6/P3 testability mandate — on Microsoft.Testing.Platform, over the Release x64 output the build gate produced
kind: command
phase: verify
command: "dotnet test --no-build -c Release -p:Platform=x64 --no-ansi --results-directory TestResults --report-trx --report-trx-filename constructor-unit-tests.trx {selector}"
cwd: Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Tests
pass_when:
  exit_code: 0
  stdout_match: "(?m)^Test run summary: Passed!"
  count_at_least:
    capture: "succeeded:\\s*(\\d+)"
    baseline_key: constructor_unit_tests
  failure_capture: "(?m)^failed (.+) \\((?:\\d+(?:ms|s|m|h) ?)+\\)\\r?$"
result_capture: {"format": "trx", "path": "TestResults/constructor-unit-tests.trx", "skip_policy": "fail"}
runtime_estimate_seconds: 180
tags: [test]
applies_to:
  - paths: ["Berreman/OpticalConstructor/**"]
selector:
  unit: class
  template: --filter-method "{value}.*" --filter-method "{value}"
  joiner: " "
  arg: "{rendered}"
  required: false
qualifier: unit
requires_gates: [build]
whole_suite: light
runtime_actual_whole_seconds: 13
---
name: invariant-s12-elev-list-empty
description: "ASSERT_INVARIANT s12-elev-list-empty (must-find-nothing) of section 'S3.1 -- Import on every start and the per-entry decision table': git grep -n -F \"ELEV0\" -- Elevation/elevation-known-findings.json"
kind: command
phase: verify
command: "\"C:/Python314/python.exe\" -m ai_strategy_generator.step_compiler.section_invariants --find-nothing Z2l0IGdyZXAgLW4gLUYgIkVMRVYwIiAtLSBFbGV2YXRpb24vZWxldmF0aW9uLWtub3duLWZpbmRpbmdzLmpzb24="
